<!-- 3. KENYA-SPECIFIC INTEGRATIONS -->
<h1>3. Kenya-Specific Integrations</h1>

<div class="highlight">
    <strong>Dunco HMS is the only hospital management system built from the ground up for the Kenyan healthcare environment.</strong> No other HMS in the market offers this combination of M-Pesa payments, SHA/SHIF insurance, DHA national connectivity, and AI-powered clinical support.
</div>

<h2>M-Pesa Payment Integration (Safaricom Daraja API)</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>STK Push</strong> &mdash; Patients receive a payment prompt on their phone and enter their M-Pesa PIN</li>
    <li><strong>Real-Time Callbacks</strong> &mdash; System receives instant confirmation from Safaricom</li>
    <li><strong>Automatic Reconciliation</strong> &mdash; Payments automatically linked to invoices</li>
    <li><strong>Transaction Tracking</strong> &mdash; Full M-Pesa transaction history visible in the system</li>
    <li><strong>Multi-Fee Support</strong> &mdash; Consultation fees, lab tests, pharmacy, admissions, deposits</li>
    <li><strong>Coverage Checks</strong> &mdash; Verify SHA coverage before processing patient payments</li>
</ul>

<h2>SHA / SHIF Integration (Social Health Authority)</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Patient Eligibility Verification</strong> &mdash; Real-time check via DHA Health Interoperability Gateway</li>
    <li><strong>Member Lookup</strong> &mdash; Find patients by National ID, CR ID, or SHA number</li>
    <li><strong>Authorization Requests</strong> &mdash; Submit pre-authorization for procedures</li>
    <li><strong>Claims Submission</strong> &mdash; Submit claims directly to SHA for reimbursement</li>
    <li><strong>Coverage Tracking</strong> &mdash; Monitor claim status, approvals, and payments</li>
    <li><strong>Service Codes</strong> &mdash; Complete Kenya SHA procedure and service code database</li>
    <li><strong>ICD-10 Codes</strong> &mdash; Standard diagnostic codes for claims and reporting</li>
</ul>

<h2>DHA Integration (Digital Health Agency)</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>National Client Registry</strong> &mdash; Verify patients against Kenya's national health database</li>
    <li><strong>Facility Registry</strong> &mdash; Look up facility details and FRN codes</li>
    <li><strong>Provider Registry</strong> &mdash; Verify healthcare provider credentials</li>
    <li><strong>Document Interchange</strong> &mdash; Send and receive clinical documents (HL7/FHIR)</li>
    <li><strong>Biometric Verification</strong> &mdash; Fingerprint and facial recognition against national database</li>
    <li><strong>Emergency Access</strong> &mdash; Emergency access tokens for urgent patient care</li>
</ul>

<h2>AI-Powered Healthcare</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Elliana D Virtual Nurse</strong> &mdash; 24/7 AI chatbot handling patient queries, appointment booking, and medical information in English and Swahili</li>
    <li><strong>AI Appointment Suggestions</strong> &mdash; Intelligent scheduling based on doctor availability and department load</li>
    <li><strong>AI Diagnosis Support</strong> &mdash; Symptom-based condition matching to assist clinicians</li>
    <li><strong>AI Predictive Analytics</strong> &mdash; Bed occupancy forecasting and revenue projections</li>
    <li><strong>AI Content Writer</strong> &mdash; Generates hospital marketing content and social media posts</li>
</ul>

<div class="page-break"></div>

