<!-- 10. SECURITY -->
<h1>10. Security &amp; Data Protection</h1>

<h3>Implemented Security Measures</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Password hashing (bcrypt, 12 rounds)</li>
    <li>Role-based access control (21 roles, 95+ permissions)</li>
    <li>CSRF protection on all forms</li>
    <li>XSS protection via Blade auto-escaping</li>
    <li>SQL injection prevention via Eloquent ORM</li>
    <li>Session management with regeneration on login</li>
    <li>Audit logging of all critical actions</li>
    <li>Module-level access control</li>
    <li>Biometric data encryption (AES-256-CBC)</li>
    <li>Secure file upload handling</li>
</ul>

<h3>Data Protection</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Daily automated backups with 30-day retention</li>
    <li>Database and file backups included</li>
    <li>Restore capability on demand</li>
    <li>Audit trail on all patient data access</li>
    <li>Role-based data visibility controls</li>
</ul>

