<!-- 14. CLIENT RESPONSIBILITIES -->
<h1>14. Client Responsibilities</h1>
<ol>
    <li>Provide hospital data (departments, services, fees, staff list) within 2 weeks of contract signing</li>
    <li>Obtain and provide M-Pesa production credentials from Safaricom</li>
    <li>Obtain and provide SHA/DHA facility credentials from Kenya Ministry of Health</li>
    <li>Designate a project coordinator</li>
    <li>Ensure stakeholder availability for training</li>
    <li>Provide feedback during UAT within 5 business days</li>
    <li>Ensure reliable internet connectivity (minimum 10 Mbps)</li>
    <li>Provide computers/tablets for system access</li>
    <li>Make payment milestones on time</li>
</ol>

<h3>Exclusions</h3>
<ul>
